cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite it as below."
title: "mx_server Fleet: From Leased IPs to the Operator's Servers"
type: dataset
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
authors:
  - family-names: Wilson
    given-names: Yanky
repository-code: "https://github.com/yankywilson/mx-server-fleet-cti"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Independent OSINT analysis of a 2,463-host templated mail-server fleet on
  leased BYOIP address space. Maps eight leased /24s to eight OVH dedicated
  servers by SSH host key, documents a Kafka backend and a scripted
  deployment, and links two fleet servers to Entra ID password-spray traffic.
  Attribution not supported.
keywords:
  - cyber threat intelligence
  - OSINT
  - BYOIP
  - IP leasing
  - snowshoe spam
  - password spraying
  - infrastructure analysis
